Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:21:13 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Spread breakable trees evenly across the map

Replace the three dense tree clumps (320 trees) with 703 trees spread over
all the walkable land (blue-noise spacing, >= ~260px between trunks).

Positions were checked against: water / road / undefined tiles, houses and
their door zones, ruins, rocks, bushes, collision walls, fixed monster spawn
points and areas the player cannot reach. The start island is left alone.
Rock entries are unchanged.

